                            <img loading="lazy" class="img-fluid jarallax-img"  src="https://liepaja-sez.lv/img/block/index/8/1701807159_FRONTPAGE_1000x100px_Investee.webp" alt="">
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-12 col-lg-5 article-block-text px-lg-5">
                            <h1>Invest in Liepaja</h1><p>The Liepaja SEZ Authority and the municipality are determined on establishing an attractive
business environment - a unified economic ecosystem with the aim of promoting
development of the city and the region, attracting new entrepreneurs, and supporting
expansion of existing companies, creating new jobs with competitive salaries, increasing
GDP and the amount of taxes paid.</p><a target="" href="//liepaja-sez.lv/en/invest-in-liepaja/" aria-label="Find out more">Find out more</a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
				<div class="col-12 article-block left">
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="col-12 col-lg-7 order-first order-lg-last jarallax">
                            <img loading="lazy" class="img-fluid jarallax-img"  src="https://liepaja-sez.lv/img/block/index/9/1695811507_FRONTPAGE_1000x100px_Osta.webp" alt="">
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-12 col-lg-5 article-block-text px-lg-5">
                            <h1>The Port</h1><p>The Port of Liepaja is the third largest port in Latvia and the city&#39;s gateway to the wider
world. The Port of Liepaja brings the essence and character of the city. Liepaja, like all cities
that have their own ports, think and live more broadly. The Port of Liepaja has a favorable
geographical location between east and west.</p><a target="" href="//liepaja-sez.lv/en/about-port/" aria-label="Find out more">Find out more</a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
				<div class="col-12 article-block right">
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="col-12 col-lg-7  jarallax">
                            <img loading="lazy" class="img-fluid jarallax-img"  src="https://liepaja-sez.lv/img/block/index/10/1695811515_FRONTPAGE_1000x100px_AttProj.webp" alt="">
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-12 col-lg-5 article-block-text px-lg-5">
                            <h1>Development projects</h1><p>In synergy with business companies, the Liepaja SEZ Authority plans long-term development
and develops projects to promote establishment of new companies based on the basic
principles of circular economy and technological growth.</p><a target="" href="//liepaja-sez.lv/lv/attistibas-projekti/" aria-label="Find out more">Find out more</a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
				<div class="col-12 article-block left">
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="col-12 col-lg-7 order-first order-lg-last jarallax">
                            <img loading="lazy" class="img-fluid jarallax-img"  src="https://liepaja-sez.lv/img/block/index/11/1695811522_FRONTPAGE_1000x100px_JahtuOsta.webp" alt="">
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-12 col-lg-5 article-block-text px-lg-5">
                            <h1>Liepaja Marina</h1><p>The Liepaja Marina is the only one in Latvia that boasts compliance with 37 requirements of
the international eco-certificate Blue Flag. The marina is located in its historical place - in the
city center, which allows tourists to easily enjoy the city&#39;s attractions. The city center, the
Rose Square and the Tourist Information Center are within a five-minute walking distance,
and the beach itself is within a fifteen minute-walk.</p><a target="" href="//liepaja-sez.lv/en/liepaja-marina/" aria-label="Find out more">Find out more</a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
				<div class="col-12 article-block right">
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="col-12 col-lg-7  jarallax">
                            <img loading="lazy" class="img-fluid jarallax-img"  src="https://liepaja-sez.lv/img/block/index/12/1695811531_FRONTPAGE_1000x100px_Lidosta.webp" alt="">
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-12 col-lg-5 article-block-text px-lg-5">
                            <h1>The Airport</h1><p>The Liepaja Airport is one of the two international airports in Latvia, which after
reconstruction was the first airport in Europe to undergo the certification process according
to the recently approved EU regulations.</p><a target="_blank" href="//liepaja-airport.lv/en" aria-label="Find out more">Find out more</a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
				<div class="col-12 article-block left">
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="col-12 col-lg-7 order-first order-lg-last jarallax">
                            <img loading="lazy" class="img-fluid jarallax-img"  src="https://liepaja-sez.lv/img/block/index/27/1707296351_416041889_368154519244518_5409449159534795603_n.webp" alt="">
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-12 col-lg-5 article-block-text px-lg-5">
                            <h1>Oskars Kalpaks Bridge</h1><p>The swing bridge is one of the oldest metal structure bridges in Latvia, opened in 1906. The
Karosta Canal is a busy shipping route, so the bridge is opened for ship traffic several times a
day. In order to find out whether Oskars Kalpaks Bridge is open, a webcam has been
installed.</p><a target="" href="//liepaja-sez.lv/en/oskars-kalpaks-bridge/" aria-label="Find out more">Find out more</a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="news_three mb-5">
